OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy to start with isolated
OL,6,Fshowers possible. The rain becoming
OL,7,Fmore widespread through the day but
OL,8,Fremaining light for most areas.
OL,9,FFeeling cool in the easterly breeze,
OL,10,Fstrongest along the coast and over the
OL,11,Fhills.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining overcast with rain
OL,14,Fbecoming patchier through the evening
OL,15,Fand overnight. Isolated clearer spells
OL,16,Fdevelop later in the night.
OL,17,FTemperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
