OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FMostly cloudy to start with
OL,6,Fpatchy rain possible. Turning drier
OL,7,Fthrough the day but remaining cloudy.
OL,8,FLighter winds than previous days but
OL,9,Ffeeling cool under the extensive cloud.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FHigh
OL,12,Fpressure continues to dominate, often
OL,13,Fbringing cloudy conditions with light
OL,14,Frain at times but some clearer spells
OL,15,Ftoo. Gentle winds. Temperatures remain
OL,16,Faround normal for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
